            <characteristic name="Traits" typeId="eaef-482b-c5d3-866e"/>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9cfa-9bd0-0b1b-9c06">While within this Terrain element, non- Long Shadow Models cannot use Special Abilities, Channel, Leech, or Focus.
Remove the Conjured Shadow Crows template in the End Phase.
There can be only one Conjured Shadow Crows in play at any time (including Enemy Effects). If a second would be put onto the battlefield, remove the first before resolving
the second effect.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
