      <profiles>
        <profile name="Opposition Preparation" id="118c-c7e4-a7c9-55ef" hidden="false" typeId="d2bb-86b4-edf3-c4e5" typeName="Special Card">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="b4b7-5338-e8e2-41fd">Play during Deployment.
Gain a number of Preparation Tokens equal to the number of models Recruited into the opposing Warband with the Sixth Sense trait.
Distribute those tokens amongst any Enemy models except Shiho Hiroto.

Models with Preparation Tokens cannot benefit from the Ranged Defence trait while a North Star model is performing a Ranged Attack.

Models with Preparation Tokens cannot benefit from Prowess, Kata, Dodge, Parry, Impenetrable Defence, Reach or Lightning Reflexes while in Melee Exchanges with North Star models.

When a model with a Preparation Token is involved in a Melee Exchange with a North Star model or Targeted by a Ranged Attack from a North Star model, remove the Preparation Token at the end of the current activation.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
    </selectionEntry>
