      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="6de4-d067-c2aa-0dc2">During Deployment, this model gains the listed Ki Feat of one Friendly Ninja model in its Warband, it is assumed that the Ki Feat is written on this model&apos;s card. If multiple models in the Warband have this rule, they may not choose the same named Ki Feat.</characteristic>
